# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Why: the working tree is Windows (CRLF via core.autocrlf) while a future
# Jenkins/CI runner will be Linux (LF). Without normalisation, the same file
# differs between contributors and every diff that touches line endings is
# noise. Normalising to LF in the index keeps checkouts reproducible across
# platforms. See decisions.md D-021.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows cannot represent LF for these; keep them as-is.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary files: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
